        <definition>Eigen::TensorFixedSize&lt; double, Eigen::Sizes&lt; nqp, 3, 3, 3 &gt; &gt; Marmot::ContinuumMechanics::Microplane::VDSplit&lt; scheme &gt;::projectionTensors::Dev</definition>
        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>Dev</name>
        <qualifiedname>Marmot::ContinuumMechanics::Microplane::VDSplit::projectionTensors::Dev</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Holds the deviatoric projection tensors for each microplane. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Projects the macroscopic strain tensor <formula id="369">$ \eps $</formula> onto the microplane deviatoric strain vector  <formula id="392">$\eps_D^{(m)} $</formula> of microplane <computeroutput>m:</computeroutput>   <formula id="393">\[  (\varepsilon_D^{(m)})_i = Dev_{ijk}^{(m)} \varepsilon_{jk}
\]</formula> Built from the microplane normal vectors <ref refid="struct_marmot_1_1_continuum_mechanics_1_1_microplane_1_1_v_d_split_1_1projection_tensors_1a5981583ac0b6c86122a143f1122a4601" kindref="member">nMatrix</ref> in initiateSystem(). For all <formula id="335">$ n_{qp} $</formula> microplanes, these are stored together in a single 4th-order tensor of size <formula id="394">$ n_{qp} \times 3 \times 3 \times 3 $</formula>, where the first index selects the microplane and <formula id="385">$ Dev^{(m)} $</formula> above denotes the corresponding 3rd-order slice. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
