        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>VolT</name>
        <qualifiedname>Marmot::ContinuumMechanics::Microplane::VDSplit::projectionTensors::VolT</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Volumetric projection tensor <formula id="395">$ V_{ij} = \delta_{ij}/3 $</formula>, tensor form of <ref refid="struct_marmot_1_1_continuum_mechanics_1_1_microplane_1_1_v_d_split_1_1projection_tensors_1a3dd8120ac7e5d892b7532e18d90adf0f" kindref="member">Vol</ref>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Projects the macroscopic strain tensor <formula id="369">$ \eps $</formula> onto the (microplane-independent) volumetric strain <formula id="396">$ \varepsilon_V $</formula>:   <formula id="397">\[  \varepsilon_V = V_{ij} \varepsilon_{ij} = \tfrac{1}{3} \operatorname{tr}( \eps )
\]</formula> </para>
        </detaileddescription>
